This is a very simple Pic viewing utility for the Psion series 3.
The included Pic file was converted from Gif format using Viewgif - a Gif 
viewer/convertor written by yours truly for the Series 3.
I may in future decide to upload the Gif viewer/convertor but at the moment
it's just too slow to be practical- it took 70 minutes to decode the included
Pic file.
Anyway, I hope you like the picture.

David Lee        4/9/92